        "changeLog": "v02 (game version 2.4.1.0)\n- Volume levelled: every voice line was normalised to a consistent loudness. Before, the quietest and the\n  loudest lines differed by about 19 dB; now they are within a few dB of each other.\n- Overall level raised to match the stock crew voices (average speech level about -12.5 dBFS).\n- Peaks limited to -1 dBFS, so there is no clipping.\n- All lines re-encoded; the download is slightly smaller."
